monitoring server) to request commands to be run on this machine (the monitored machine) which return the status of the machine.\n- Submit the same results to a remote (monitoring server).\n- Take action and perform tasks.","moniker":"nscp","name":"NSClient++","packageUrl":"https://nsclient.org/","publisher":"MySolutions NORDIC","publisherUrl":"https://medin.name/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/tag/0.11.25","tags":["icinga","naemon","nagios"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"可与多种监控工具协同使用的全功能监控代理","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"NSClient++（nscp）旨在成为一个简单而强大且安全的监控守护进程。它最初为 Nagios/Icinga 设计，但守护进程本身并不局限于 Nagios/Icinga，可广泛应用于需要接收或分发检查指标的其他场景中。\n该守护进程主要具备三项核心功能：\n- 允许远程主机（监控服务器）请求在本机（被监控主机）上执行命令，以获取主机状态信息。\n- 将相同的检测结果主动提交至远程（监控服务器）。\n- 执行预设操作并完成任务处理。","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/tag/0.11.25","tags":[]}},"publisherUrl":"https://medin.name/","releaseDate":"2026-03-24","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/tag/0.11.25","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.12.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/m/Mickem/NSClient/0.11.25.0/Mickem.NSClient.yaml","sha256":"02e5620bd9a042409bfa76e094e35eff75420d4104b232864c3923348e335bb8"},{"path":"manifests/m/Mickem/NSClient/0.11.25.0/Mickem.NSClient.installer.yaml","sha256":"d156cfe9a37b74bfd58577a47703bc76f8906e432633fdb5ff60c93d8dd2b8a8"},{"path":"manifests/m/Mickem/NSClient/0.11.25.0/Mickem.NSClient.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"23e1349a260e8abe3ab25199139d84b0d97c2860d5b2d0d5129124ada2ada385"},{"path":"manifests/m/Mickem/NSClient/0.11.25.0/Mickem.NSClient.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"7fcf6716ce1cd3d87da2f5bfcd3af4d785432d207558fb3cc5986f7d2d8bcf94"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"0.11.25.0"}